// Dragon Ball - Over 9000!
// Primary: ORANGE (#FF7700) - Goku's iconic gi
// Secondary: DARK BLUE (#2244AA) - Goku's undershirt, kanji
// Accents: YELLOW (Super Saiyan aura), RED (power/ki)
// Grey tint: WARM ORANGE - the fiery DBZ battle aesthetic
// Automation: BLUE (Kamehameha) - distinct from orange/yellow active states
// Yellow = "powered up" state for active elements
// Author: Claude

